{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"houfei-e-p009d","title":"刘良相甄氏称贵不可言","accounts":[{"id":"houfei-e-p009d-account","label":"《魏书》","text":"魏书称刘良相甄氏及诸子，指甄氏贵不可言；占相作为该书叙事。","evidence":["houfei-e-p009d-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"houfei-p0030","role":"相人","evidence":["houfei-e-p009d-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"甄逸卒后","precision":"undated","basis":"保留本条时间表达，不据相邻段落自动补年。","evidence":["houfei-e-p009d-q"]},"ordering_evidence":"houfei-e-p009d-q","source_order":[5,88,"P009d"],"order":1383}],"persons":[{"id":"houfei-p0030","name":"刘良","evidence":["houfei-q-p009"],"facts":[],"aliases":[],"mentions":[{"id":"houfei-m-p009-houfei-p0030","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["houfei-q-p009"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"houfei-e-p009d-q","section":"chapter-005","block":"b-f5444ab8ae602f01c130","layer":"pei","quote":"后相者刘良，相后及诸子，良指后曰：‘此女贵乃不可言！","attribution":"《魏书》","section_title":"后妃传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0015.xhtml","index":87,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-021d19b721b6c9edc251","start":122,"end":148,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"houfei-q-p009","section":"chapter-005","block":"b-f5444ab8ae602f01c130","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝一﹞《魏书》曰：“逸娶常山张氏，生三男五女：长男豫，早终；次俨，举孝廉，大将军掾，曲梁长；次尧，举孝廉；长女姜，次脱，次道，次荣，次即后。后以汉光和五年十二月丁酉生。每寝寐，家中仿佛见如有人持玉衣覆其上者，常共怪之。逸薨，加号慕，内外益奇之。后相者刘良，相后及诸子，良指后曰：‘此女贵乃不可言！’后自少至长，不好戏弄。年八岁，外有立骑马戏者，家人诸姊皆上阁观之；后独不行。诸姊怪问之，后答言：‘此岂女人之所观邪？’年九岁，喜书，视字辄识，数用诸兄笔砚。兄谓后言：‘汝当习女工。用书为学，当作女博士邪？’后答言：‘闻古者贤女，未有不学前世成败，以为己诫。不知书，何由见之？’”","attribution":"《魏书》","section_title":"后妃传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0015.xhtml","index":87,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-021d19b721b6c9edc251","start":0,"end":288,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
